'''Golem Sunfish''' (古兵器マンボロス, ''Koheiki Manborosu'', '''Ancient Weapon Manboros''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Sunfish Jones]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

